-- EarthFluent, 11 Nov 2026: the same find-and-replace that made Germany "Japanesey" also wrote each course's own
-- language over other nationalities in the Ethnicities lessons, and over Hindi in two Languages lessons. Found by
-- comparing every course's English titles with the others slot by slot. The fourth slot of Ethnicities, Part 7 is
-- Spanish in the Spanish course, and Spain follows Colombia in Countries, so it is Spanish everywhere; every other
-- course, Italian included, had its own language there. Each row gets its English title, its translation and its
-- URL code back, the old path reserved so it still resolves. Every update is guarded by the broken value it replaces.
SET NAMES utf8mb4;
START TRANSACTION;

-- English titles and codes
